  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 077: A package substrate translates fine die connections into board-level power and signals while resisting warpage.

Lesson 078: Integrated supply helps only when shared information and authority shorten learning loops across factories.

Lesson 079: GPUs preserve option value across uncertain workloads, while custom silicon earns its efficiency only at stable, utilized scale.

